[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]关键人物与事件[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]甄氏（文昭甄皇后）[/color] — 感甄说的核心人物


[indent]•  本为[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "袁绍", "cat": "people"}]袁绍[/url][/color]之子[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "袁熙", "cat": "people"}]袁熙[/url][/color]之妻[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  曹操破邺（204年）后，曹丕纳之为妾，后升正室，生[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "曹叡", "cat": "people"}]曹叡[/url][/color][/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
